column5:
`emulator delete --json` prints the same document pretty-printed with sorted keys, byte-for-byte in the style of `JSONOutput.string` (`{
  "deleted" : true,
  "name" : "fix-k30"
}`). • Errors (refusals) are unchanged. • GrantivaCLITests (EmulatorCommandTests or OutputStreamContractTests): the delete JSON equals `JSONOutput.string` of an equivalent Encodable; optionally a contract test that no command under `Sources/GrantivaCLI` calls `JSONSerialization.data` for `--json` output. (brief K30 Acceptance criteria; Platforms: android)
